<title>ESTONIA: Estonian Dec m/m CPI 0.7 pct, yr/yr 14.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Estonian Dec m/m CPI 0.7 pct, yr/yr 14.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>December inflation in Estonia was 0.7 percent month-on-month for a 14.8-percent year-on-year rise, the statistics office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN CONSUMER PRICES     Dec '96     Nov '96    Dec '95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   +0.7	 +0.6	 +2.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		+14.8	+16.4	+28.9</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	    242.6	241.0	211.3</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
